{"item":{"key":"moment:1298736","id":"1298736","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1621612800000,"text":"一体机的出发点是为了节省成本，或者是源于过于广泛的兴趣爱好。\n但一体机做久了有弊端，人会在自己越发熟练的方面养成惯性和渐渐孤僻，导致闭门造车和闭目塞听。如何平衡“试着依赖他人”和“不想给他人添麻烦”对我来讲，也是一个很复杂的课题。\n比如画画，自己来可以需要时即时搞定，但去找画师就要排单，这个等待的时间对于没有长远安排的人来说就很难熬。\n有时候事情太多了也想试着去让别人帮忙，但常常不知如何下口。想一想，其实可能也是社交懒人的惯性吧_(:3 ⌒ﾞ)_","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":95,"likeCount":208,"bananaCount":225,"shareCount":1},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/1298736","timePrecision":"day","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":85,"archivedRoots":45,"threads":{"442795840":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442795840/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442795840","root":"442795840","user":{"id":"16005","name":"乌拉喵","avatar":"dcd319804ad474edfbe0e6de"},"text":"因完全不具备一体机的能力，所以非常佩服和羡慕一体机大神们[emot=acfun,2011/]尝试过去完成更多的事，但发现时间和精力都不够，还是专业的事交给专业的人吧[emot=acfun,2011/]","time":1621745493363,"floor":49,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"442563150":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442563150/1.json"],"savedReplies":9,"reportedReplies":9,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442563150","root":"442563150","user":{"id":"339216","name":"贫道李天尘","avatar":"5f812945e185e76eeb867fab"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1699/][emot=acfun,1699/][emot=acfun,1699/]你需要一条像我这样的舔狗！","time":1621717829781,"floor":41,"likes":22,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":9,"hot":true}},"442492553":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442492553/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442492553","root":"442492553","user":{"id":"782258","name":"孩子，你爸是你母亲的父亲啊！","avatar":"39576a92e5535f04f91e7931"},"text":"一体机完全是因为兴趣 X\n一体机是因为自己有需求并且自己做出来的东西更切合自身需求 √\n\n一体机一定能节约时间 X\n一体机一定能省钱 √\n\n一体机是把命运（整个制作流程及时间）掌握在自己手中 √\n一体机很累很辛苦 √√√\n一体机归根结底是因为穷 √√√√√\n（如果又有钱又能找到符合自己心意的乙方还能工期准时，谁不愿意舒舒服服当个甲方爸爸呢？）","time":1621709788004,"floor":39,"likes":5,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"442444327":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442444327/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442444327","root":"442444327","user":{"id":"16620617","name":"閃閃FLASH1NG","avatar":"71b5ec5a1f602b9a7ca7e7d1"},"text":"我已经开始带入了\n一个人做音乐，一个人后期，一个人剪辑\n太寂寞了。","time":1621704038104,"floor":34,"likes":30,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":true}},"442356247":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442356247/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442356247","root":"442356247","user":{"id":"3595154","name":"睡莲","avatar":"8240f74b3f2a93d28ce2186f"},"text":"我想成为一体机的原因是我太穷了[emot=acfun,1860/]，虽然我还没能做到一体机[emot=acfun,1680/]","time":1621693547085,"floor":30,"likes":32,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":true}},"442321253":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442321253/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442321253","root":"442321253","user":{"id":"14633746","name":"狗椛-rua","avatar":"266e63af5bb4b446dc53410b"},"text":"一体机性能比较多样但是没有专精，有一些基本的东西自己能做就做，但是有的还是要请专业人才来比较好[emot=acfun,1689/]\n\n\n其实主要是没钱请人帮忙做[emot=acfun,1711/]","time":1621690264752,"floor":27,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"442319213":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442319213/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442319213","root":"442319213","user":{"id":"8500263","name":"猫猫子NENEKO","avatar":"58b30d0ab6aad125c58179f0"},"text":"我也是，约稿又怕麻烦人又怕交流出现问题...如果是自己做的话就很方便跟自己妥协_(:з)∠)_","time":1621690045331,"floor":26,"likes":24,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":true}},"442287175":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442287175/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442287175","root":"442287175","user":{"id":"212476","name":"CAY全家桶","avatar":"36e96461c5690041cf23e210"},"text":"在时间有限的情况下，把部分别人能够胜任的工作托住付给他人，不失为一种折中之选。而且一体机在部分领域可能跟他人全力专精的存在差距，把这方面交给他人也是追求作品的精益求精。[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621685579137,"floor":23,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"442282125":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442282125/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442282125","root":"442282125","user":{"id":"13446878","name":"欠债雀士银之间半步尊爵","avatar":"d7b3297ac2ab8cedea9e945f"},"text":"看样子水姐的问题不是能力不够而是时间不够呢，这就是强者吗[emot=acfun,1689/]\n其实我觉得倒也不必考虑那么多，比如找画师画画，也是应该要给画师一定的报酬吧，算是甲方乙方的关系，没有谁给谁添麻烦一说吧，而且只要说话态度不差，相信对方就算拒绝也不会有什么不满情绪[emot=acfun,1683/]\n唉，也就都是理论，至于如何说话或者进一步深入关系，我也老社恐了，只能多实践吧[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621685120879,"floor":21,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false}},"442277594":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442277594/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442277594","root":"442277594","user":{"id":"39087204","name":"闲云九霄","avatar":"8aabd0110ef4fa54b009437b"},"text":"我的经验是\n1，和领域内做得好的人聊其领域的东西。（需要结识更多优秀的人）\n2，不要羞于求助于可以求助的好朋友，适当互相帮助有利于增进友谊。","time":1621684707627,"floor":19,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false}},"442269574":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442269574/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442269574","root":"442269574","user":{"id":"7379348","name":"小救星小灶","avatar":"7c2bc7eb134c7c0ee879ef3b"},"text":"那就接单，然后拿接单赚的钱去约画师。这样既可以了解不同画师的风格，也可以知道妹妹仔的奇思妙想。[emot=acfun,1689/]","time":1621683968709,"floor":16,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false}},"442269199":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442269199/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442269199","root":"442269199","user":{"id":"869274","name":"千寻℃","avatar":"8c383118e4f1f74f8ea10152"},"text":"其实对于我来说很多的时候是&quot;与其和别人沟通需求，不去我自己来干来的简单方便&quot;\n特别是工作上的事情，能自己做就自己做，不会就学，不懂就自己百度。因为和同事沟通，交代事情，花费的时间远远不如自己动手来的高效。\n交代一个事情下去，可能三天都不见搞好，而且不一定是自己想要的效果，自己俩小时搞定了。\n有些人是真的墨迹，看着他们干活我都累得慌。\n所以慢慢也就养成了啥事儿都自己干的习惯","time":1621683933839,"floor":15,"likes":4,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false}},"442266833":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442266833/1.json"],"savedReplies":2,"reportedReplies":2,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442266833","root":"442266833","user":{"id":"1144684","name":"风格豆腐丶","avatar":"748956af4ed1271d1b6333fb"},"text":"完全理解，工作中通过寻求帮助来改善快被固化的人际关系，简单来说就是芝麻点事都问下同事；开始都是很难开口的，加油吧[emot=acfun,1678/]","time":1621683720832,"floor":14,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":2,"hot":false}},"442264372":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442264372/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"442264372","root":"442264372","user":{"id":"419474","name":"棉花街","avatar":"ee2737a83a4978ca0704a818"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1684/]其实可以搞几张纯图看看，比如星鸟画画，然后阿望在旁边扫地，水曜日穿着围裙在做饭这种。画图如果长期只在舒适区，感觉久了会越看越疲劳。当然我这可能不对，因为我本身也不会画，但是我现在总会给找点不一样的题目给画师。如果最后的图出的够好，我也挺满足","time":1621683493248,"floor":12,"likes":3,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"442262612":{"pages":["comments/1298736/threads/442262612/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedR